  "metadata": {
    "NAME": "MD simulations of DNMT1 and its disease-associated mutations - D490E-P491Y",
    "DESCRIPTION": "Mutations in the DNA methyltransferase 1 (DNMT1) gene can lead to neurodegenerative diseases, including autosomal dominant cerebellar ataxia-deafness and neuropathy (ADCA-DN) and hereditary sensory and autonomic neuropathy type 1E (HSAN1E). This project presents four independent, all-atom, two-microsecond molecular dynamics (MD) simulations of wild-type DNMT1 and three ADCA-DN variants, as well as two HSAN1E variants.",
